name: libopusfile
description: An API for decoding and seeking within .opus files
version: 0.12
date: 20260617-18.26
author: See AUTHORS file
submitter: Michael Trebilcock
url: https://opus-codec.org/
category: development/library/audio
replaces: development/library/audio/libopusfile.lha
requirements: libopus libogg
license: Other
minosversion: 4.1
distribute: yes
fileid: 13885
hend:


Rebuilt to link against newer libopus .so

HTTP support is disabled in this port because it requires features not present in the OS4 SDK at this time.

---

The opusfile and opusurl libraries provide a high-level API for
decoding and seeking within .opus files.

Programming documentation is available in tree and online at
https://opus-codec.org/docs/

----

Thanks to kas1e for the previous port(s) prior to 0.12.

